The function is already minimal, so I only made the single profile load explicit and added a branch hint that the valid (non-zero) path is the common case, improving code layout and letting the compiler emit a leaner fast path.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 Field::GetOffset() const
{
    const Profile* const p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect((p == NULL) || (profileIndex >= p->numFields), 0))
        return 0;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].offset;
}
```